  "question": {
    "text": "The number of values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> lying in the interval <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfying the equation <math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have<br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />So, <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Z</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Z</mi></math><br />in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, the number of values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> is <math><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
